sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Admin
    participant FE as Admin Dashboard
    participant API as Backend API (Express)
    participant DB as MongoDB

    A->>FE: Open orders page
    FE->>API: GET /api/admin/orders
    API->>DB: Find all orders + populate user
    DB-->>API: Orders list
    API-->>FE: Orders payload

    A->>FE: Update order status
    FE->>API: PUT /api/admin/orders/:id
    API->>DB: Update status / delivery fields
    DB-->>API: Updated order
    API-->>FE: Updated order response

    A->>FE: Remove order
    FE->>API: DELETE /api/admin/orders/:id
    API->>DB: Delete order
    DB-->>API: Deletion confirmed
    API-->>FE: "Order Removed"
